WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:06,591
Behave yourself

2
00:00:06,591 --> 00:00:13,820
Now is the time to talk officially.

3
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:16,020
This is a new case that the bureau just received

4
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:18,320
Chengdong Old Town, one week in a row

5
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:20,920
At twelve o'clock every night, citizens call the police

6
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:23,820
Witnesses said that on an old street that was about to be demolished

7
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:26,120
I saw a woman wearing a red ancient wedding dress

8
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:27,220
wandering in the street

9
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:29,220
Moreover, every time a woman appears

10
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:32,820
There will be faint sounds of extremely desolate sounds all around.

11
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:34,020
Are there any casualties?

12
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:35,820
There are currently no direct fatal cases

13
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:38,620
However, all citizens who have witnessed this ghost-hearted girl

14
00:00:38,820 --> 00:00:41,020
They all experienced varying degrees of mental trance afterwards.

15
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:42,220
High fever that persists

16
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:44,120
Some people even fell into severe coma

17
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:46,220
He is still being treated in the intensive care unit.

18
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:48,420
The technical department went to the outside to measure energy fluctuations.
